---
import BasePage from '../layouts/BasePage.astro';
---

<BasePage>
    <div class="con-content">
        <h3>Freshers' Week</h3>
        <p>
            We will have a stand at the sports fair on Monday where you can come and talk to us. 
            We'll also be signing people up for trial lessons during the fair.
        </p>

        <h3>Mailing List</h3>
        <p>The gliding club mailing list is the main route of communication, where weekly flying is organised and announcements are made. 
            To subscribe, email <a href="mailto:sympa@mlist.is.ed.ac.uk">sympa@mlist.is.ed.ac.uk</a> with the text "subscribe gliding Firstname Lastname" (withot quotes) in the body of the message, where, of course, you substitute your first and last name.</p>

        <h3>Mail</h3>
        <p>Snail mail should be directed at: Edinburgh University Gliding Club, Sports Union Office, 48 Pleasance, Edinburgh EH8 9TJ</p>

        <h3>Email</h3>
        <p>
            You can email the President or Secretary, for example to request trial flight information, 
            at <a href="mailto:gliding@ed.ac.uk">gliding@ed.ac.uk</a>.
        </p>

        <h3>WhatsApp</h3>
        <p>
            You can join the WhatsApp group chat for EUGC related matters <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/H8miD7nqOmc3K6WmqeG3St?mode=ems_copy_t">here</a>. 
            We sometimes organise last minute flying, curries, and trips through the WhatsApp group.
        </p>
    </div>
</BasePage>

<style>
    .con-content {
        margin-left: 10%;
        margin-right: 10%;

        margin-top: 96px;
        margin-bottom: 96px;

        text-align: justify;
    }
    .con-content h1 {
        margin-top: 48px;
    }

    a {
		text-decoration: none;
		color: var(--col-accent);
	}

    .img-banner {
        background-image: url("../assets/training.jpeg");
        background-size: cover;

        width: 100%;
        height: 500px;

        border-radius: 8px;
    }
</style>